WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.430
A village headman, leader
of professional soldiers,

2
00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:05.720
came to the Buddha with a question.

3
00:00:05.770 --> 00:00:10.480
His teachers had told him that warriors
who die fighting are reborn in heaven,

4
00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:13.240
among the gods of those slain in battle.

5
00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:14.520
Was it true?

6
00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:19.310
Twice, the Buddha declined to answer,
and told him to leave the question.

7
00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:22.960
Why would the Buddha refuse
a soldier's sincere question?

8
00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:27.560
In this mission, you'll read what happened
when the soldier asked a third time.

9
00:00:27.610 --> 00:00:32.160
Then you'll see how the Buddha's own
clan nearly went to war over a river,

10
00:00:32.210 --> 00:00:33.640
and what he did.

11
00:00:33.690 --> 00:00:37.060
Your mission: find out why the
Buddha held back his answer,

12
00:00:37.110 --> 00:00:39.080
and what it means for war.
